OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely cloudy and dry day
OL,6,Fbut with a few brighter intervals. The
OL,7,Fodd light outbreak of rain is
OL,8,Fpossible, particularly in the morning.
OL,9,FStrong southeasterly winds with gales
OL,10,For severe gales developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly dry start to the
OL,13,Fevening, with only some light
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain across Shetland.
OL,15,FLater, rain arrives to Orkney, moving
OL,16,Feastwards toward Shetland overnight.
OL,17,FVery windy with gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
