OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA wet start, with rain
OL,6,Fspreading eastwards through the
OL,7,Fmorning, leading to a drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter afternoon across Orkney, with
OL,9,Fsome sunshine. Rain clearing Shetland
OL,10,Fthrough the evening. Winds easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fwith rain and strong winds at times on
OL,14,FSaturday. Bright spells and showers on
OL,15,FSunday. Further rain and strong winds
OL,16,Farriving from the west on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
